{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即漸教十地、圓\n教十地等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十方世界法門皆是四諦法門"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此佛乘中無假法言說，名相總真"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "主方便波羅蜜"}
{"id": null, "n": "0831001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0831001", "type": "orig", "text": "之疑以"}
{"id": null, "n": "0834001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0834001", "type": "orig", "text": "舍疑含"}
{"id": null, "n": "0835001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0835001", "type": "orig", "text": "千疑干"}
{"id": null, "n": "0835002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0835002", "type": "orig", "text": "我疑或"}
{"id": null, "n": "0846001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0846001", "type": "orig", "text": "廣曙曰此揀淨土不得作實話會行願品中文殊大智願生極樂佛無妄語有為二字第為執著人說耳袁中郎西方合論不可不熟看卓老當時借不轉一語"}
{"id": null, "n": "0851001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0851001", "type": "orig", "text": "廣曙曰若作權會一大藏教皆是止啼黃葉耳須知極樂與華藏一因陀羅網法門長者遮淨土亦豈實耶"}
{"id": null, "n": "0856001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0856001", "type": "orig", "text": "發疑法"}
{"id": null, "n": "0860001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0860001", "type": "orig", "text": "列疑別"}
{"id": null, "n": "0865001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0865001", "type": "orig", "text": "廣曙曰南無梵語皈命之詞或作曩謨此以南方虛無解之是長者遊戲三昧勿認作實語"}
{"id": null, "n": "0867001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0867001", "type": "orig", "text": "提下疑脫心"}
{"id": null, "n": "0874001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0874001", "type": "orig", "text": "廣曙云非至差別非字當是必字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0875001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0875001", "type": "orig", "text": "先疑光"}
